# Lure of the Wildcat (Jeuno) (jeuno 90): the guard xi.settings.main.ENABLE_TOAU == 1 compares the setting as the Lua
# number it is, so a fraction (1.25) is not 1: not offered; Ajithaam's script starts nothing (no ToAU mission), so his
# default 10092 plays. A port that rounds the setting (Settings.Main) would offer 10088.
lists UpperJeuno/Ajithaam/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/10088
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-79.7,0,161.5 job=WAR lvl=20
setting ENABLE_TOAU 1.25
login
trigger Ajithaam               # ENABLE_TOAU 1.25: not offered; his default 10092
finish
